S DE CADENA LARGA Y CADENA MEDIA:Long-chain and medium-chain triglycerides are types of fats that are significant in dietary management for certain medical conditions.", "DRA. ROSA BURGOS PELÁEZ:", "GRASA SATURADA:GRASA SATURADA refers to saturated fat, a type of fat that can significantly impact cardiovascular health and is frequently discussed in dietary studies. This type of fat is primarily found in animal-based foods and tropical oils. It is associated with an increase in cholesterol levels and a heightened risk of cardiovascular diseases (ECV). Research indicates that replacing saturated fat with monounsaturated fatty acids can lead to a reduction in LDL cholesterol, suggesting that dietary choices regarding fat types can influence heart health.", "ÁCIDOS GRASOS SATURADOS DE CADENA LARGA:Los ácidos grasos saturados de cadena larga son un tipo de grasa que se asocia con un mayor riesgo de arteriosclerosis y ECV.", "ACEITE DE PALMA:El aceite de palma es un tipo de grasa que contiene una mayor proporción de ácidos grasos saturados de cadena larga, lo que lo relaciona con el riesgo de ECV.", "FITOESTEROLES:Fitoesteroles, also known as phytosterols, are plant-derived compounds recognized for their potential health benefits, particularly in relation to cardiovascular health. They are known to aid in reducing cholesterol levels by decreasing cholesterol absorption in the intestines, which can lead to lower levels of LDL cholesterol. This dual action of helping to reduce overall cholesterol and improving heart health makes fitoesteroles a valuable component in dietary strategies aimed at promoting cardiovascular well-being.", "FIBRA SOLUBLE:La fibra soluble es un tipo de fibra que puede influir positivamente en la salud cardiovascular.", "VITAMINAS ANTIOXIDANTES:Las vitaminas antioxidantes son nutrientes que ayudan a combatir el estrés oxidativo y pueden mejorar la salud cardiovascular.", "AGS:AGS refers to saturated fatty acids, which are discussed in the context of 